<FILE Name="/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/NbdExport/README.md">
<INLINE>
<![CDATA[
**NBD Export**

Export a disk or partition as a **Network Block Device** (NBD) and image remote NBD targets to qcow2/raw on Unraid. Lives under **Settings → Network Services → NBD** next to NFS and SMB. Prefer private binds (Thunderbolt Net IPs when available). Read-only by default. Standalone — Thunderbolt Net and FRR are optional companions.
]]>
</INLINE>
</FILE>

